{
    "title": "Fuel Rewards\u00ae program",
    "description": "For a limited time, all Fuel Rewards members receive instant Gold Status.\r\n \r\nThe Fuel Rewards\u00ae program (aka Fuel Rewards Network or FRN), is a free loyalty program that helps you save money on fuel at over 11,000 Shell stations, nationwide. Fuel Rewards members with Gold Status save at least 5\u00a2gal on every fill-up. You can earn additional Fuel Rewards savings when you shop, dine, book travel and more. Rewards are cumulative, and there is no limit to how much you can save. Rewards apply to any fill-up, up to 20 gallons.\r\n\r\nAPP FEATURES\r\n\u2022 Track rewards balance and tier status\r\n\u2022 Activate offers\r\n\u2022 Find ways to earn rewards\r\n\u2022 Locate nearby Shell stations\r\n\r\nWAYS TO EARN REWARDS\r\n\r\nAt Shell: With Gold Status, you\u2019ll save at least 5\u00a2/gal on every fill-up at participating Shell stations. Also, you can earn rewards at select Shell stations when you purchase snacks, beverages, car washes and more. (If you don't maintain Gold Status, you'll drop to Silver Status and save 3\u00a2/gal on every fill-up at participating Shell stations)\r\n \r\nDine: Earn 10\u00a2/gal for every $50 you spend at more than 10,000 participating restaurants nationwide with a linked Mastercard, Visa, or American Express credit/debit card. (you must use as credit, not debit)\r\n\r\nShop:  Earn at least 5\u00a2/gal for every $50 you spend at select local and online merchants.\r\n\r\nTravel: Earn 5\u00a2/gal for every $50 spent when you book hotels, flights, and rental cars, through the Fuel Rewards program.\r\n\r\nMore: Find additional promotions at select regional grocery stores, other affiliated programs, and online at fuelrewards.com.\r\n \r\nSome offers must be activated prior to earning. Use the mobile app to easily activate these offers.\r\n\r\nHOW TO SAVE AT THE PUMP\r\n\r\n\u2022 Use the app to find a participating Shell or other participating fuel stations.\r\n\u2022 Enter your ALT ID, a Fuel Rewards loyalty card, or use a linked credit card \r\n\u2022 Watch the price rollback.\r\n\r\nShell is the official fuel provider of the Fuel Rewards program. Participation varies by market.",
    "descriptionHTML": "For a limited time, all Fuel Rewards members receive instant Gold Status.<br> <br>The Fuel Rewards\u00ae program (aka Fuel Rewards Network or FRN), is a free loyalty program that helps you save money on fuel at over 11,000 Shell stations, nationwide. Fuel Rewards members with Gold Status save at least 5\u00a2gal on every fill-up. You can earn additional Fuel Rewards savings when you shop, dine, book travel and more. Rewards are cumulative, and there is no limit to how much you can save. Rewards apply to any fill-up, up to 20 gallons.<br><br>APP FEATURES<br>\u2022 Track rewards balance and tier status<br>\u2022 Activate offers<br>\u2022 Find ways to earn rewards<br>\u2022 Locate nearby Shell stations<br><br>WAYS TO EARN REWARDS<br><br>At Shell: With Gold Status, you\u2019ll save at least 5\u00a2/gal on every fill-up at participating Shell stations. Also, you can earn rewards at select Shell stations when you purchase snacks, beverages, car washes and more. (If you don&#39;t maintain Gold Status, you&#39;ll drop to Silver Status and save 3\u00a2/gal on every fill-up at participating Shell stations)<br> <br>Dine: Earn 10\u00a2/gal for every $50 you spend at more than 10,000 participating restaurants nationwide with a linked Mastercard, Visa, or American Express credit/debit card. (you must use as credit, not debit)<br><br>Shop:  Earn at least 5\u00a2/gal for every $50 you spend at select local and online merchants.<br><br>Travel: Earn 5\u00a2/gal for every $50 spent when you book hotels, flights, and rental cars, through the Fuel Rewards program.<br><br>More: Find additional promotions at select regional grocery stores, other affiliated programs, and online at fuelrewards.com.<br> <br>Some offers must be activated prior to earning. Use the mobile app to easily activate these offers.<br><br>HOW TO SAVE AT THE PUMP<br><br>\u2022 Use the app to find a participating Shell or other participating fuel stations.<br>\u2022 Enter your ALT ID, a Fuel Rewa